ne | - | 0 | pending |\n+<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n+\n+## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n+<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n+- Max iterations: 10\n+- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n+- Stop policy: convergence\n+- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n+- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n+- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n+- Session lineage: sessionId=`fanout-sol-c-1784385520599-ecg4bg`, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n+- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n+- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n+- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n+- Severity threshold: P2\n+- Review target type: spec-folder\n+- Cross-reference checks: core=`spec_code,checklist_evidence`; overlay=`feature_catalog_code,playbook_capability`\n+- Started: 2026-07-18T14:44:20Z\n+<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-config.json","relativePath":".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-config.json","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-config.json\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-config.json\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-config.json\n@@ -0,0 +1,131 @@\n+{\n+  \"topic\": \"Review: .opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization\",\n+  \"sessionId\": \"fanout-sol-c-1784385520599-ecg4bg\",\n+  \"parentSessionId\": null,\n+