ctual fixtures for the gate and retry path (`design-md-generator/**/__fixtures__/study-*`).\n72: <!-- /ANCHOR:phase-2 -->\n73: \n74: ---\n75: \n76: <!-- ANCHOR:phase-3 -->\n77: ## Phase 3: Verification\n78: \n79: - [ ] T010 Prove reversibility — STUDY-disabled output is byte-identical to the pre-STUDY WRITE path.\n80: - [ ] T011 Confirm the leak gate trips and forces a clean no-STUDY retry across every seeded leak fixture.\n81: <!-- /ANCHOR:phase-3 -->\n82: \n83: ---\n84: \n85: <!-- ANCHOR:completion -->\n86: ## Completion Criteria\n87: \n88: - [ ] STUDY is a separate, reversible pre-WRITE phase (SC-001)\n89: - [ ] The transformer emits no verbatim source values or phrases (SC-002)\n90: - [ ] The two-signal leak gate discards and retries without STUDY on every seeded leak (SC-003)\n91: - [ ] STUDY ships with transformation + provenance + leakage controls together — no raw few-shot shortcut (SC-004)\n92: <!-- /ANCHOR:completion -->\n93: \n94: ---\n95: \n96: <!-- ANCHOR:cross-refs -->\n97: ## Cross-References\n98: \n99: - **Specification**: `spec.md`\n100: - **Plan**: `plan.md`\n101: - **Checklist**: `checklist.md`\n102: - **Parent**: `../spec.md`\n103: <!-- /ANCHOR:cross-refs -->\n\n(End of file - total 103 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"---\ntitle: \"Tasks: bounded STUDY exemplars for design-md-generator\"\ndescription: \"Build queue for the reversible pre-WRITE STUDY phase: one-bundle guarded hydration, de-literalized observation transformer, target-facts-bound prompt block, provenance/rights/injection envelope, two-signal source-leak gate with no-STUDY retry, and adversarial fixtures. All tasks pending; depends on phases 004 + 005.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"md generator study tasks\"\n  - \"STUDY exemplar tasks\"\n  - \"source-leak gate tasks\"\nimportance_tier: \"important\"\ncontextType: \"implementation\"\n_memory:\n  continuity:\n    packet_pointer: \"sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/006-md-generator-study-exemplars\"\n    last_updated_a