child alignment, research-to-plan lineage, checklist evidence, and metadata parity\n+- [x] D3 Traceability: parent/child alignment, research-to-plan lineage, checklist evidence, and metadata parity\n - [ ] D4 Maintainability: document hygiene, naming, stable contracts, and safe follow-on execution\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n ## 4. NON-GOALS\n@@ -37,14 +37,15 @@\n | Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n |-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n | D1 Correctness | CONDITIONAL | 1 | Phase ordering and planned statuses are sound; resume continuity is stale in the parent and research children 002-003. |\n | D2 Security | CONDITIONAL | 2 | Rights, cache, and authority controls align; the STUDY pre-prompt injection boundary is unspecified. |\n+| D3 Traceability | CONDITIONAL | 3 | Core protocols executed: checklist evidence passes; spec/code is partial because F002 remains. Checklist denominators drift in six phases. |\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n ## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n - **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n-- **P1 (Major):** 2 active\n+- **P1 (Major):** 3 active\n - **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n - **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +1 P1, +0 P2\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n@@ -96,12 +97,12 @@\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n \n | Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n |----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n-| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Planned phases require claim-to-current-surface checks without expecting implementation. |\n-| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Checked research claims and unchecked planned-phase gates require evidence review. |\n-| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Applicable only where packet claims a discoverable current sk-design surface. |\n-| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | Applicable only where child packets claim executable playbook capability. |\n+| `spec_code` | core | partial | 3 | Research maps to phases except F002 prompt-injection fixture coverage. |\n+| `checklist_evidence` | core | pass | 3 | Checked research tasks resolve to substantive evidence; planned rows are unchecked. |\n+| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | 3 | No packet-local feature catalog delivery claim. |\n+| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | 3 | No packet-local playbook capability claim. |\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n ## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n","additions":7,"deletions":6}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA .opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/iterations/iteration-003.md\nA .opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deltas/iter-003.jsonl\nM .opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-state.jsonl\nM .opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-strategy.md","time":{"start":1784386775715,"end":1784386775725}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_044a7c061df10273016a5b943aa7bc8191a8ce1346a555e13f"}},"id":"prt_f75bb054f0013s49BR2gKPrRmb","sessionID":"ses_08a55b97effep2EaPBEqRiOfI4","messageID":"msg_f75bad608001KZ0N3rkLyK2co8"}}
