and reducer:\n  - `F001` P1: stale `_memory.continuity` routes resumed work toward completed research instead of phase 004.\n- Initial reducer failure `Missing machine-owned anchor \"review-dimensions\" in deep-review strategy file.` was repaired with `--create-missing-anchors`; subsequent reducer run passed.\n- Iteration 2 security passed verification and reducer:\n  - `F002` P1: phase 006 names an injection envelope but lacks enforceable pre-prompt injection controls/adversarial gates.\n- Iteration 3 traceability artifacts were written:\n  - `F003` P1: six of seven implementation checklists publish incorrect P0/P1/P2 summary denominators.\n  - `spec_code=partial`; `checklist_evidence=pass`; overlays marked not applicable.\n  - F002 refined with upstream research evidence requiring embedded prompt-injection fixtures.\n\n### Active\n- Iteration 3 has not yet run `verify-iteration.cjs` or `reduce-state.cjs`.\n- Current expected active findings: F001-F003, all P1.\n- Maintainability iteration 4 and at least one stabilization iteration remain before legal convergence.\n- F001’s reducer registry entry lost rich fields because its delta finding event was minimal; a later stabilization record should refresh its description, class, scope proof, and content hash.\n\n### Blocked\n- No hard blocker.\n- Memory MCP timeouts and absent code graph are documented fallback conditions, not stop blockers.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Heartbeat the lock, verify iteration 3, and run the canonical reducer; inspect registry/dashboard for corruption, search debt, and traceability state.\n2. Run iteration 4 maintainability, then stabilization iterations until two consecutive passes introduce no new P0/P1 and all legal STOP gates pass; synthesize `review-report.md`, `resource-map.md`, terminal state, verify artifacts, release the lock, and emit the completion marker.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-config.json`: immutable lineage configuration.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-state.jsonl`: append-only authoritative state.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-findings-registry.json`: reducer-owned finding state.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-strategy.md`: review charter and next focus.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deep-review-dashboard.md`: reducer-generated status.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/iterations/iteration-001.md`: correctness review.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/iterations/iteration-002.md`: security review.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/iterations/iteration-003.md`: pending-verification traceability review.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deltas/iter-003.jsonl`: pending-verification iteration 3 delta.\n- `.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep_review_auto.yaml`: canonical workflow.\n- `.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs`: iteration artifact gate.\n- `.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs`: canonical reducer.","time":{"start":1784386797173,"end":1784386815152},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_02db1761ba54db60016a5b94ed1dc48191a74c743f6e9f4580","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
