{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1784387352175,"sessionID":"ses_08a55b97effep2EaPBEqRiOfI4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_YcFUDo6iwCdILpbtP4slpzIF","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/002-md-generator-upgrade/research/lineages/sol/research.md","offset":304,"limit":20},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/002-md-generator-upgrade/research/lineages/sol/research.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n304: - flat versus shadowed; surface/no-surface; radius/no-radius;\n305: - p10/p90 token-category shapes;\n306: - semantic core roles, valid extensions, and collision fallbacks;\n307: - known core-order and capability anomalies;\n308: - valid STUDY pair and no-eligible-candidate fallback;\n309: - stale generation/hash, missing provenance, and unknown-rights literal;\n310: - embedded prompt injection and DESIGN/token disagreement;\n311: - source-only values/URLs/identifiers;\n312: - normalized 7/8/11/12-word boundaries, one versus two hits, punctuation/case normalization, shared boilerplate, and target-authorized coincidences;\n313: - target fact mutations after STUDY and capability counterfactuals;\n314: - deterministic update/check byte stability and add/change/delete invalidation.\n315: \n316: Focused tests should extend current formatter, prompt, validator, and report suites rather than replace them. The full backend test command remains the final gate. [SOURCE: iterations/iteration-004.md:21-25]\n317: \n318: ## 16. References\n319: \n320: ### Iteration evidence\n321: \n322: - `iterations/iteration-001.md`: pipeline and contract boundaries.\n323: - `iterations/iteration-002.md`: complete corpus schema/vocabulary calibration.\n\n(Showing lines 304-323 of 358. Use offset=324 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata"