{"type":"text","timestamp":1784387386868,"sessionID":"ses_08a55b97effep2EaPBEqRiOfI4","part":{"id":"prt_f75c6bb000014LeWaI4w4c8tS1","messageID":"msg_f75c6a2a1001bf4Bcy4EiCxEPi","sessionID":"ses_08a55b97effep2EaPBEqRiOfI4","type":"text","text":"The stabilization replay confirms all five findings against unchanged source evidence and finds no adjacent variant or new P0/P1. I’m recording a zero-novelty fifth iteration with both core traceability protocols re-evaluated; after verification, the legal-stop bundle can be assessed from stored evidence.","time":{"start":1784387386112,"end":1784387386866},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_07ee43e13907934a016a5b973a1390819187254e65441b8bf8","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1784387554498,"sessionID":"ses_08a55b97effep2EaPBEqRiOfI4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_ilKnzdDu4r7UGpn3w9F928k8","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: .opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/iterations/iteration-005.md\n+# Iteration 5: Stabilization Replay\n+\n+## Dispatcher\n+\n+- Budget profile: verify\n+- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n+- Prior active findings: F001-F005\n+- Search mode: graphless fallback using direct evidence replay and adjacent-variant exact searches\n+\n+## Files Reviewed\n+\n+- Lifecycle continuity across the parent, research children 001-003, and current phase 004.\n+- Phase-002 research safety matrix and phase-006 STUDY spec, plan, tasks, checklist, and summary.\n+- All seven implementation checklists and their live P0/P1/P2 row counts.\n+- Phase-004 canonical document endings and task-queue handoff.\n+- Reducer registry, dashboard, strategy, and candidate-coverage state through iteration 4.\n+\n+## Findings - New\n+\n+### P0 Findings\n+\n+None.\n+\n+### P1 Findings\n+\n+None.\n+\n+### P2 Findings\n+\n+None.\n+\n+## Active-Finding Replay\n+\n+| Finding | Severity | Replay result | Evidence |\n+|---------|----------|---------------|----------|\n+| F001 | P1 | Confirmed unchanged | Parent still says run child 001; research-child specs 002-003 still retain pre-research dispatch state while their summaries report 100% completion. |\n+| F002 | P1 | Confirmed unchanged | Phase-002 research names embedded prompt injection; phase 006 specifies an auditable envelope and post-generation leak tests but no hostile-instruction rejection or neutralization before prompt assembly. |\n+| F003 | P1 | Confirmed unchanged | Live row counts remain 15/23/8 for phase 004 and differ from 13/16/6; analogous mismatches remain in phases 006-010 except the matching phase-005 control. |\n+| F004 | P2 | Confirmed unchanged | Seven unmatched closing transport tags remain confined to phase 004 canonical documents. |\n+| F005 | P2 | Confirmed unchanged | The summary still says T001-T028 while the authoritative queue ends at T030. |\n+\n+## Adjacent-Variant Search\n+\n+- No additional orphan `content` or `invoke` wrappers occur in implementation phases 005-010.\n+- No second bounded task-range mismatch occurs in canonical target documents.\n+- Planned-scaffold `TBD` dates are explicitly qualified and do not claim completed verification.\n+- Proposed engine paths remain consistently labeled NEW/proposed and do not claim that missing files already exist.\n+- No new prompt-injection control was found that would resolve or downgrade F002.\n+\n+## Traceability Checks\n+\n+| Protocol | Status | Gate | Evidence | Notes |\n+|----------|--------|------|----------|-------|\n+| `spec_code` | partial | hard | research handoff and phase-006 planning docs | Phase sequencing and planned-status claims align, but F002 remains an unresolved research-to-plan safety omission. |\n+| `checklist_evidence` | pass | hard | research task evidence and implementation checklist rows | Checked research claims resolve; planned implementation rows are unchecked. F003 remains denominator drift rather than false checked evidence. |\n+| `feature_catalog_code` | notApplicable | advisory | packet inventory | No packet-local feature-catalog delivery claim. |\n+| `playbook_capability` | notApplicable | advisory | packet inventory | No packet-local playbook capability claim. |\n+\n+## Convergence Evidence\n+\n+- All four configured dimensions have evidence-bearing coverage.\n+- Iterations 4 and 5 introduced no new P0/P1 findings.\n+- Active P0 count is zero.\n+- Every active finding has direct file/line evidence and a bounded remediation.\n+- Candidate coverage has no deferred or blocked rows and no search debt.\n+- Graph unavailability is covered by direct reads, exact searches, live-row counts, and explicit negative-search proof.\n+- No finding was claimed fixed, so fix-completeness replay has zero required rows.\n+- The latest claim-adjudication event passes for all active P0/P1 findings.\n+\n+## Verdict\n+\n+The finding set is stable at three P1 and two P2 findings. The packet is not ready for an unconditional PASS, but the autonomous review has legally converged with a CONDITIONAL verdict and no P0 release blocker.\n+\n+Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n*** Add File: .opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deltas/iter-005.jsonl\n+{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":5,\"mode\":\"review\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"run\":\"sol-c-005\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"stabilization replay across active findings\",\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\",\"security\",\"traceability\",\"maintainability\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/spec.md:10-47,95-125\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/002-md-generator-upgrade/spec.md:10-52\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/003-global-modes-utilization/spec.md:10-52\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/002-md-generator-upgrade/research/lineages/sol/research.md:304-316\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/006-md-generator-study-exemplars/plan.md:76-135\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/checklist.md:127-133\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/006-md-generator-study-exemplars/checklist.md:148-154\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/007-shared-context-seam/checklist.md:148-154\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/008-interface-audit-pilots/checklist.md:127-133\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/009-foundations-motion/checklist.md:133-139\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/010-open-design-transport/checklist.md:126-132\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/implementation-summary.md:144-150\"],\"findingsCount\":5,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":3,\"P2\":2},\"findingsNew\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":0},\"findingsRefined\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":0},\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"F001\",\"findingId\":\"F001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"category\":\"correctness\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"title\":\"Resume continuity points back to completed research\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/spec.md\",\"line\":15,\"description\":\"Resume continuity still directs the operator to completed research instead of the phase-004 frontier.\",\"evidence\":\"Parent next_safe_action still says run child 001; research-child specs 002-003 retain pre-research dispatch state while summaries report completion.\",\"recommendation\":\"Route continuity to phase 004 and reconcile completed research-child metadata.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"lifecycle-state\",\"scopeProof\":\"Stabilization replay compared parent and child continuity fields against completion summaries and the phase map.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"session resume\",\"phase routing\",\"parent continuity\"],\"content_hash\":\"c573671842aef0aa61fb93e6b7d0c7a43fc1f1320f1e48a356adfa6db64a50fd\"},{\"id\":\"F002\",\"findingId\":\"F002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"category\":\"security\",\"dimension\":\"security\",\"title\":\"STUDY lacks an enforceable pre-prompt injection gate\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/006-md-generator-study-exemplars/plan.md\",\"line\":83,\"description\":\"The STUDY plan does not reject or neutralize hostile corpus instructions before prompt assembly.\",\"evidence\":\"Upstream research requires embedded prompt-injection coverage; phase 006 defines an envelope and authored-output leak tests but no pre-prompt hostile-instruction fixture.\",\"recommendation\":\"Specify the pre-prompt injection gate and adversarial fixtures before STUDY implementation.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"cross-consumer\",\"scopeProof\":\"Stabilization replay searched every phase-006 canonical document for hostile-instruction controls and checked the upstream safety matrix.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"study hydration\",\"study transformer\",\"buildWritePrompt\",\"buildPlan\",\"runGuided\"],\"content_hash\":\"fcafdcafff36250dff8e257e1c6d0e13d629786af0b56f07f115302114e355ac\"},{\"id\":\"F003\",\"findingId\":\"F003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"category\":\"traceability\",\"dimension\":\"traceability\",\"title\":\"Verification Summary totals undercount checklist obligations\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/checklist.md\",\"line\":127,\"description\":\"Six implementation checklists publish summary totals that disagree with live priority-tagged rows.\",\"evidence\":\"Fresh exact counts over every implementation checklist reproduce the denominator mismatches and the phase-005 control match.\",\"recommendation\":\"Derive or mechanically validate every summary denominator from live checklist rows.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"matrix/evidence\",\"scopeProof\":\"Stabilization replay recounted P0, P1, and P2 rows in all seven implementation checklists.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"phase checklists\",\"completion reconciliation\",\"strict validation\"],\"content_hash\":\"e6025011ac3d86253aa4d633aa5887d01bd29c414da57797bd1bedfcb3ac3a13\"},{\"id\":\"F004\",\"findingId\":\"F004\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"category\":\"maintainability\",\"dimension\":\"maintainability\",\"title\":\"Phase 004 documents retain orphan transport tags\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieva