ation checklists.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"phase checklists\",\"completion reconciliation\",\"strict validation\"],\"content_hash\":\"e6025011ac3d86253aa4d633aa5887d01bd29c414da57797bd1bedfcb3ac3a13\"},{\"id\":\"F004\",\"findingId\":\"F004\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"category\":\"maintainability\",\"dimension\":\"maintainability\",\"title\":\"Phase 004 documents retain orphan transport tags\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/spec.md\",\"line\":283,\"line_range\":\"283-284\",\"description\":\"All six phase-004 canonical documents end with unmatched </content>, and spec.md also ends with unmatched </invoke>.\",\"evidence\":\"Packet-wide exact search found seven closing transport tags, all in phase 004, with no corresponding opening tags.\",\"recommendation\":\"Remove the orphan tags and validate canonical documents for malformed wrapper residue.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"artifact-hygiene\",\"scopeProof\":\"Exact malformed-tag searches covered every Markdown file under the phase parent and localized all matches to phase 004.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"phase 004 Markdown rendering\",\"anchor extraction\",\"routed context ingestion\"],\"content_hash\":\"0ceb90d3104e2eaa2a0bd5f53ba022816036432ea983b4853e65e39ca85095b5\"},{\"id\":\"F005\",\"findingId\":\"F005\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"category\":\"maintainability\",\"dimension\":\"maintainability\",\"title\":\"Phase 004 handoff truncates the task queue at T028\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/implementation-summary.md\",\"line\":146,\"line_range\":\"144-149\",\"description\":\"The handoff summary bounds implementation at T001-T028 although tasks.md defines governance tasks T029-T030.\",\"evidence\":\"The only bounded task range in the summary omits the task that maps modules to ADR authorities and the task that promotes validated ADRs.\",\"recommendation\":\"Use T001-T030 or de