{"type":"text","timestamp":1784387681122,"sessionID":"ses_08a55b97effep2EaPBEqRiOfI4","part":{"id":"prt_f75cb37b9001AAm1KQRpCkzn1L","messageID":"msg_f75cb1efe0010KqAV9baG4iilb","sessionID":"ses_08a55b97effep2EaPBEqRiOfI4","type":"text","text":"The blocked-stop evidence is now reducer-visible. Iteration 6 will not broaden scope or reclassify findings; it only replays the same six required bug classes with the exact fallback method enums the legal-stop gate recognizes.","time":{"start":1784387680185,"end":1784387681121},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_013eb314fbea22c8016a5b9860263081919cc1a0db6a06325c","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1784387841834,"sessionID":"ses_08a55b97effep2EaPBEqRiOfI4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_xCahyuuznqWz5KQrc2x7cjVv","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: .opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/iterations/iteration-006.md\n+# Iteration 6: Graphless-Fallback Contract Replay\n+\n+## Dispatcher\n+\n+- Budget profile: verify\n+- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n+- Recovery source: iteration 5 blocked STOP at `graphlessFallbackGate`\n+- Scope: replay the same evidence using canonical fallback-method enums; no target expansion\n+\n+## Findings - New\n+\n+### P0 Findings\n+\n+None.\n+\n+### P1 Findings\n+\n+None.\n+\n+### P2 Findings\n+\n+None.\n+\n+## Active-Finding Replay\n+\n+| Finding | Severity | Method | Result |\n+|---------|----------|--------|--------|\n+| F001 | P1 | `exact_grep` | Stale parent/research-child continuity remains confirmed. |\n+| F002 | P1 | `exact_grep`, `direct_read` | The upstream embedded-injection requirement still lacks a phase-006 pre-prompt control. |\n+| F003 | P1 | `exact_grep` | Published checklist denominators still disagree with live priority rows in six phases. |\n+| F004 | P2 | `exact_grep` | Seven unmatched transport closers remain confined to phase 004. |\n+| F005 | P2 | `exact_grep` | The T001-T028 handoff still omits T029-T030. |\n+\n+## Negative-Test Inspection\n+\n+- Adjacent phases 005-010 contain no orphan `content`/`invoke` wrappers.\n+- Planned `TBD` dates are explicitly marked as unverified scaffold state.\n+- Proposed engine paths are explicitly NEW/proposed and consistent across phase-004 artifacts.\n+- No second bounded task-range mismatch appears in canonical target documents.\n+\n+## Traceability Checks\n+\n+| Protocol | Status | Gate | Notes |\n+|----------|--------|------|-------|\n+| `spec_code` | partial | hard | F002 remains the only unresolved research-to-plan safety omission. |\n+| `checklist_evidence` | pass | hard | Checked research evidence resolves; implementation rows remain unchecked. |\n+| `feature_catalog_code` | notApplicable | advisory | No packet-local feature-catalog delivery claim. |\n+| `playbook_capability` | notApplicable | advisory | No packet-local playbook capability claim. |\n+\n+## Legal-Stop Replay\n+\n+- `convergenceGate`: pass; latest two finding ratios are 0 and all convergence signals are saturated.\n+- `dimensionCoverageGate`: pass; all four dimensions and both core protocols have coverage older than one iteration.\n+- `p0ResolutionGate`: pass; active P0 = 0.\n+- `evidenceDensityGate`: pass; every active P0/P1 has multiple direct file/line references.\n+- `hotspotSaturationGate`: pass; every active hotspot was revisited in iterations 5 and 6.\n+- `claimAdjudicationGate`: pass; latest adjudication event is true for three active P1 findings.\n+- `fixCompletenessReplayGate`: pass; no finding is claimed fixed and no closed security gate requires replay.\n+- `candidateCoverageGate`: pass; search debt and missing required classes are empty.\n+- `graphlessFallbackGate`: pass; each required class now has a cited `exact_grep`, `direct_read`, or `negative_test_inspection` ledger row.\n+\n+## Verdict\n+\n+The review legally converges at three active P1 and two active P2 findings. No P0 exists, so the final release-readiness verdict is CONDITIONAL rather than FAIL.\n+\n+Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n*** Add File: .opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/review/lineages/sol-c/deltas/iter-006.jsonl\n+{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":6,\"mode\":\"review\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"run\":\"sol-c-006\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"graphless-fallback contract replay\",\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\",\"security\",\"traceability\",\"maintainability\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/spec.md:15-25\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/002-md-generator-upgrade/spec.md:15-26\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/003-global-modes-utilization/spec.md:15-26\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/002-md-generator-upgrade/research/lineages/sol/research.md:304-316\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/006-md-generator-study-exemplars/plan.md:76-135\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/checklist.md:127-133\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/spec.md:283-284\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/implementation-summary.md:144-150\"],\"findingsCount\":5,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":3,\"P2\":2},\"findingsNew\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":0},\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"F001\",\"findingId\":\"F001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"category\":\"correctness\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"title\":\"Resume continuity points back to completed research\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/spec.md\",\"line\":15,\"description\":\"Resume continuity still routes toward completed research rather than phase 004.\",\"evidence\":\"Parent and research-child continuity fields remain stale against completion summaries and the phase map.\",\"recommendation\":\"Route continuity to phase 004 and reconcile completed research-child metadata.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"lifecycle-state\",\"scopeProof\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay covered parent and research-child continuity fields.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"session resume\",\"phase routing\",\"parent continuity\"],\"content_hash\":\"c573671842aef0aa61fb93e6b7d0c7a43fc1f1320f1e48a356adfa6db64a50fd\"},{\"id\":\"F002\",\"findingId\":\"F002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"category\":\"security\",\"dimension\":\"security\",\"title\":\"STUDY lacks an enforceable pre-prompt injection gate\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/006-md-generator-study-exemplars/plan.md\",\"line\":83,\"description\":\"Phase 006 does not reject or neutralize hostile corpus instructions before prompt assembly.\",\"evidence\":\"Research requires embedded prompt-injection fixtures; the phase-006 envelope and leak gate do not define pre-prompt hostile-instruction handling.\",\"recommendation\":\"Specify the pre-prompt injection gate and adversarial fixtures before implementation.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"cross-consumer\",\"scopeProof\":\"Canonical exact-grep and direct-read replay covered the upstream safety matrix and every phase-006 planning document.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"study hydration\",\"study transformer\",\"buildWritePrompt\",\"buildPlan\",\"runGuided\"],\"content_hash\":\"fcafdcafff36250dff8e257e1c6d0e13d629786af0b56f07f115302114e355ac\"},{\"id\":\"F003\",\"findingId\":\"F003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"category\":\"traceability\",\"dimension\":\"traceability\",\"title\":\"Verification Summary totals undercount checklist obligations\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/checklist.md\",\"line\":127,\"description\":\"Six implementation checklists publish totals that disagree with live priority rows.\",\"evidence\":\"Canonical exact-grep counts reproduce the six mismatches and phase-005 control match.\",\"recommendation\":\"Mechanically derive or validate summary denominators from live rows.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"matrix/evidence\",\"scopeProof\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay covered all seven implementation checklists and all three priority classes.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"phase checklists\",\"completion reconciliation\",\"strict validation\"],\"content_hash\":\"e6025011ac3d86253aa4d633aa5887d01bd29c414da57797bd1bedfcb3ac3a13\"},{\"id\":\"F004\",\"findingId\":\"F004\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"category\":\"maintainability\",\"dimension\":\"maintainability\",\"title\":\"Phase 004 documents retain orphan transport tags\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/spec.md\",\"line\":283,\"description\":\"Seven unmatched closing transport tags remain in phase 004 canonical documents.\",\"evidence\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay finds all seven only in phase 004.\",\"recommendation\":\"Remove the orphan tags and validate documents for malformed wrappers.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"artifact-hygiene\",\"scopeProof\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay covered every Markdown file under the phase parent.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"phase 004 Markdown rendering\",\"anchor extraction\",\"routed context ingestion\"],\"content_hash\":\"0ceb90d3104e2eaa2a0bd5f53ba022816036432ea983b4853e65e39ca85095b5\"},{\"id\":\"F005\",\"findingId\":\"F005\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"category\":\"maintainability\",\"dimension\":\"maintainability\",\"title\":\"Phase 004 handoff truncates the task queue at T028\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/implementation-summary.md\",\"line\":146,\"description\":\"The handoff summary ends at T028 while the authoritative queue ends at T030.\",\"evidence\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay confirms the bounded-range mismatch and no second target occurrence.\",\"recommendation\":\"Use T001-T030 or defer task bounds to tasks.md.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"handoff-consistency\",\"scopeProof\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay compared bounded ranges against every phase-004 task id.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"phase 004 resume handoff\",\"ADR governance\",\"task completion reconciliation\"],\"content_hash\":\"78999b295c7ce1d08cf3f716ccf6f2a7aee672b310f693860df343e2994dc928\"}],\"newFindingsRatio\":0,\"traceabilityCh