 define pre-prompt hostile-instruction handling.\",\"recommendation\":\"Specify the pre-prompt injection gate and adversarial fixtures before implementation.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"cross-consumer\",\"scopeProof\":\"Canonical exact-grep and direct-read replay covered the upstream safety matrix and every phase-006 planning document.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"study hydration\",\"study transformer\",\"buildWritePrompt\",\"buildPlan\",\"runGuided\"],\"content_hash\":\"fcafdcafff36250dff8e257e1c6d0e13d629786af0b56f07f115302114e355ac\"},{\"id\":\"F003\",\"findingId\":\"F003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"category\":\"traceability\",\"dimension\":\"traceability\",\"title\":\"Verification Summary totals undercount checklist obligations\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/checklist.md\",\"line\":127,\"description\":\"Six implementation checklists publish totals that disagree with live priority rows.\",\"evidence\":\"Canonical exact-grep counts reproduce the six mismatches and phase-005 control match.\",\"recommendation\":\"Mechanically derive or validate summary denominators from live rows.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"matrix/evidence\",\"scopeProof\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay covered all seven implementation checklists and all three priority classes.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"phase checklists\",\"completion reconciliation\",\"strict validation\"],\"content_hash\":\"e6025011ac3d86253aa4d633aa5887d01bd29c414da57797bd1bedfcb3ac3a13\"},{\"id\":\"F004\",\"findingId\":\"F004\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"category\":\"maintainability\",\"dimension\":\"maintainability\",\"title\":\"Phase 004 documents retain orphan transport tags\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/spec.md\",\"line\":283,\"description\":\"Seven unmatched closing transport tags remain in phase 004 canonical documents.\",\"evidence\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay finds all seven only in phase 004.\",\"recommendation\":\"Remove the orphan tags and validate documents for malformed wrappers.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"artifact-hygiene\",\"scopeProof\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay covered every Markdown file under the phase parent.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"phase 004 Markdown rendering\",\"anchor extraction\",\"routed context ingestion\"],\"content_hash\":\"0ceb90d3104e2eaa2a0bd5f53ba022816036432ea983b4853e65e39ca85095b5\"},{\"id\":\"F005\",\"findingId\":\"F005\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"category\":\"maintainability\",\"dimension\":\"maintainability\",\"title\":\"Phase 004 handoff truncates the task queue at T028\",\"file\":\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/004-retrieval-substrate/implementation-summary.md\",\"line\":146,\"description\":\"The handoff summary ends at T028 while the authoritative queue ends at T030.\",\"evidence\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay confirms the bounded-range mismatch and no second target occurrence.\",\"recommendation\":\"Use T001-T030 or defer task bounds to tasks.md.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"handoff-consistency\",\"scopeProof\":\"Canonical exact-grep replay compared bounded ranges against every phase-004 task id.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"phase 004 resume handoff\",\"ADR governance\",\"task completion reconciliation\"],\"content_hash\":\"78999b295c7ce1d08cf3f716ccf6f2a7aee672b310f693860df343e2994dc928\"}],\"newFindingsRatio\":0,\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"summary\":{\"required\":2,\"executed\":2,\"pass\":1,\"partial\":1,\"fail\":0,\"blocked\":0,\"notApplicable\":2,\"gatingFailures\":0},\"results\":[{\"protocolId\":\"spec_code\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"gateClass\":\"hard\",\"applicable\":true,\"counts\":{\"checked\":3,\"passed\":2,\"partial\":1},\"evidence\":[\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk-design-styles-utilization/002-md-generator-upgrade/research/lineages/sol/research.md:304-316\",\".opencode/specs/sk-design/011-sk